  "job": "Throws lamp-shadows of beasts over the enemy line and sends them running.",
  "difficulty": 2,
  "lore": "At the Noon Fair, Tunlan's lamp-shadow of a hound made a whole street flinch, and she has been working out ever since how much further a shadow can go. Serenade puppeteers have always thrown beasts on the walls of the Lamp Dome for the children. Tunlan throws them over an enemy line, wide and tall and sudden, and the line remembers every old fear it ever had. She wears a hat like a lampshade and never uses the word frightening. She says the shadows are only asking people to go somewhere else.",
